[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 374 - Level up before combat
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Ranger Class at level 1 (level 2, {1}{G}: whenever you attack, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature) and Grizzly Bears, with two green mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-class-level-up | Leveling up a Class is a sorcery-speed activated ability, and the level-2 ability applies from then on (CR 716.2a-c): level up in the main phase, then the attack trigger puts a counter on the Bears for 3; the floating green would be gone by combat anyway
